  "body": "Most DMs are nameless, so that for either party, the name of the other member shows.\r\nRoom aliases for DMs are quite useful - but not if they \"grab\" the room name, so that no longer the name of the other member shows.\r\nFor normal rooms this does not happen, so having the same (non-)behaviour for DMs should be a - very welcome - simplification of both the spec and of implementations.",
